WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.920
We got away from Edamon, but not for long.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.900
I wanted us to be ready, and knowing the crest and tags could create a Digivolve,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.840
I tried to give as much energy to Agumon as he could take.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.440
But things didn't go so well.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.700
Edamon attacked us with an evil Greymon,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.880
and when my guy tried to fight, he was just too full of food.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.300
That's when I made a mistake.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.250
I forced him to Digivolve again.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.430
He turned into Skull Greymon and defeated the evil Greymon,

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.770
but then he turned on us.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.910
Thankfully, he ran out of energy and returned to a Coromon state.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.370
I'll never do that again.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:07.580
Girls, girls, girls.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:33.630
Okay, so I may have made a slight mistake, and who hasn't?

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:37.230
But that techno-doofus Edemon nailed us big time with that other Greymon.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:41.510
Our Greymon used up so much energy fighting him, he did evolve back into Coromon.

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.890
Man, this desert is so hot, even a lizard would need sunscreen.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:47.770
Carry me.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:50.230
Not even.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:52.690
A crew cut would look nice on you, and it's cooler.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.520
Do I look fat?

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.200
No, you look hot, especially with a fur coat.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.760
That thing really needs a zipper.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.510
Or maybe just removable shirt sleeves.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.990
Hey, how about resting our feet?

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:06.350
There's no place to sit except on a cactus.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.190
Great view up next time I ride.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.110
You look terrible, Coromon.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.680
If only I hadn't acted like such a bonehead,

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.200
you never would have digivolved.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.270
Self, although come to think,

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.860
you really made a super icky mess of things.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.760
Thanks, Mimi.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:23.860
Don't mention it, Ty.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.950
I'm glad to help with the pep talk now and then.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:37.920
I haven't sweated this much since cheerleader tria-

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.220
Coromon doesn't look so good. I'm worried.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.920
You know what we need right now is a whole bunch of shade,

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.310
a big umbrella or a really big tree.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.500
Go into a giant cactus and smile down onto all of you

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.540
as I provide cool, refreshing comfort.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:53.540
It's official.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:57.200
The sun has just turned Palmon's brain into a french fry.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.300
