00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.140
Yeah, you better believe it, Palmon.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.160
Come on, everybody, let's head for some shade.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:28.990
What happened to the shade?

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:31.950
Huh?

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.320
It was just a mirage. We've been tricked.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:42.430
