00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.460
They ended up worse off than when they started.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.960
Take a look at poor Agumi.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.360
He is just not himself, and I'm supposed to be helping him.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.710
I think those thingies are more trouble than they're worth.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.370
Calm down, kids. Let me explain.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.560
The tags and crests are extremely important.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:14.160
Please make sure no one else gets a hold of them.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:18.740
In the end, you shall see that they will work together to help you create total harmony.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:19.540
Wow.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:25.330
Just trust me. After all, I'm the floating glowing guy.

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.950
As for Coramon, he wouldn't be so helpless if you had known how to care.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.120
for him in the proper way but I did the best I could patience is what you need

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.160
to learn my friends and you will learn it in time but I want to have all come on

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:42.650
back now I'm starting to lose my connection that's something you're going

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:47.960
to have to figure out all by yourself good luck wait a minute sorry I'm on a

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:53.650
tight schedule it never fails every time I need to know about something he

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:59.910
hangs me out to dry properly if we were Agumon wouldn't have did

